      <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">Please proceed with the onboarding check list in the navigation panel. If you have any questions, reach out to me at <a href="mailto:mikhail@girshovich.me" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">mikhail@girshovich.me</a>.</p>
